[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3833828255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741#issuecomment-3833828255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741","id":3833828255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kg5Of","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T08:57:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T08:57:30Z","body":"Please see the [optimization guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/optimization.html), can you provide some data on the results of these optimizations?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3833828255/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837231904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741#issuecomment-3837231904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741","id":3837231904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kt4Mg","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T19:46:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T19:46:48Z","body":"## Benchmarks\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmark code</summary>\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nusing BenchmarkDotNet.Attributes;\r\nusing BenchmarkDotNet.Godot.Attributes;\r\nusing BenchmarkDotNet.Godot.Attributes.Jobs;\r\nusing BenchmarkDotNet.Godot.Running;\r\nusing Godot;\r\n\r\npublic partial class EmitSignalBenchmark : Node\r\n{\r\n    public override void _Ready()\r\n    {\r\n        GodotBenchmarkRunner.RunWithBBCodeAsync<Benchmarks>(isDebug: true);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n[MemoryDiagnoser, GodotSimpleJob]\r\npublic partial class Benchmarks : Node\r\n{\r\n    [Signal] public delegate void OnSendValuesEventHandler(int value1, string value2, double value3);\r\n\r\n    [GodotBenchmark]\r\n    public void EmitSignalParams()\r\n    {\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 1_000_000; i++)\r\n        {\r\n            EmitSignal(SignalName.OnSendValues, 6, \"hello world\", 139.24);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    [GodotBenchmark]\r\n    public void EmitSignalSpan()\r\n    {\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 1_000_000; i++)\r\n        {\r\n            EmitSignal(SignalName.OnSendValues, [6, \"hello world\", 139.24]);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### 1 time (.NET 10)\r\n\r\n(Both take same amount of time in BenchmarkDotNet.Godot because they both take one frame)\r\n\r\n| Method           | Mean     | Error    | StdDev   | Allocated |\r\n|----------------- |---------:|---------:|---------:|----------:|\r\n| EmitSignalParams | 16.61 ms | 0.005 ms | 0.005 ms |     634 B |\r\n| EmitSignalSpan   | 16.62 ms | 0.006 ms | 0.006 ms |     512 B |\r\n\r\n### 1,000,000 times (.NET 10)\r\n\r\n| Method           | Mean    | Error    | StdDev   | Gen0       | Gen1       | Allocated |\r\n|----------------- |--------:|---------:|---------:|-----------:|-----------:|----------:|\r\n| EmitSignalParams | 1.177 s | 0.0085 s | 0.0080 s | 40000.0000 | 39000.0000 | 244.14 MB |\r\n| EmitSignalSpan   | 1.002 s | 0.0031 s | 0.0029 s | 17000.0000 | 16000.0000 | 106.81 MB |\r\n\r\nBased on the 1,000,000 times benchmark, I will suggest passing a span is ~15% faster and allocates ~55% less memory.\r\n\r\n@AThousandShips","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837231904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837235710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741#issuecomment-3837235710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741","id":3837235710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kt5H-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T19:48:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T19:48:06Z","body":"And in real world code? It might improve things in toy examples but not in real world cases","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837235710/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837240509","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741#issuecomment-3837240509","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741","id":3837240509,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kt6S9","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T19:49:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T19:49:42Z","body":"> And in real world code? It might improve things in toy examples but not in real world cases\r\n\r\nI don't know how I would benchmark that. The span overload was specifically added by DE-YU to be more performant than the array overload.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837240509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4084017965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741#issuecomment-4084017965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741","id":4084017965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zbSst","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u